# build/packages/omarchy-pi5-base.packages — core package list.
# Same desktop identity (Hyprland, Quickshell, agents) on aarch64.
# Lines starting with # are comments. Installed by install/pi/03-pacstrap.sh
# (and preinstalled by build/build-image.sh for the image build).
#
# VERIFIED 2026-09-06 against the live ALARM databases
# (tests/check-pkg-availability.sh — all entries below exist in
#  core/extra/alarm/aur repos of mirror.archlinuxarm.org).
# Only repo packages belong here; AUR packages live in build/packages/aur.txt.

# --- Base system ---
base
base-devel
linux-rpi
linux-rpi-headers
raspberrypi-bootloader
raspberrypi-overlays
raspberrypi-utils
firmware-raspberrypi
rpi5-eeprom
wireless-regdb
linux-firmware
e2fsprogs
btrfs-progs
dosfstools
exfatprogs
util-linux
sudo
openssh
networkmanager
wpa_supplicant
iwd
bluez
bluez-utils
avahi
nss-mdns
mkinitcpio
zram-generator
snapper
cronie

# --- Desktop stack (Omarchy identity) ---
